        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I downloaded the update now and tested it out, and I am able to do my workflow ^^ Thanks!\n\nI agree that it is a lot of work for something that might be niche (do people not diff against old deleted files?). Maybe there appears more use-cases in the future, but for now, I am happy with the alternate flow 😊 ",
